 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Janas 开源 C 语言工具，让 32 GB 内存笔记本运行 48 GB LLM","summary":"Maurizio Cammalleri 发布 Janas-LLM，通过从 NVMe SSD 流式读取混合专家并缓存常用专家，让 32 GB 内存笔记本运行 48.4 GB 的 Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prabanta-dev/janas","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T22:05:43.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"e625mapxj2z0oz3sccyhrih82"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"改装 Ledger Nano X 被植入 eSIM 和 LTE 模块，窃取用户助记词","summary":"攻击者在 Ledger Nano X 中加装硬件，通过拦截 Secure Element 向屏幕传输的内容识别助记词，再利用 LTE modem、eSIM 和天线将其回传。区块链观察者称目前已发现超过 300 个受影响钱包，损失约 9300 万美元；Ledger 建议过去三个月从 Cryptobilis 购买设备的用户不要继续使用，并尽快转移资产。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://www.heise.de/en/news/Crypto-thieves-sell-hardware-wallets-with-secret-eSIM-11485188.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T08:34:12.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"oo1lzg0bdd7cmcgd9g5evr6cx"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Anthropic 分享 Scion：面向 AI 代理规模重构源代码管理","summary":"Anthropic 构建内部版本控制系统 Scion，并在五个月内将单体仓库从 Git 完整迁移过去，以应对代码合并量从每天约 2,500 次增至 30,000 多次以及大规模检出带来的压力。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/redesigning-source-control","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T15:49:56.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"c0xrxp58cs1kl8q3rc9i31xsz"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"SolidCraft：用 Rust 开源参数化 3D CAD，并支持 MCP","summary":"SolidCraft 是一款用纯 Rust 构建的开源参数化 3D CAD 应用，支持桌面端、浏览器、CLI 和内置 MCP server，可通过参数化特征时间线创建与重建模型。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bherbruck/solidcraft","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:04.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"c66fupyv4qk7qb44m4cgzdft4"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Anthropic 介绍如何加强 Claude 的模型蒸馏攻击防御","summary":"Anthropic表示，针对通过大规模请求提取 Claude 能力的蒸馏攻击，其新防御已使推理令牌提取量降低10至100倍以上，并减少约90%至99%的被窃取数据。方案包括限制推理内容跨模型、账号和对话流转，使用两阶段分类器拦截提取请求，以及对持续攻击的账号施加限流和封禁；分类器误报率低于0.1%，但部分开发者需要更新集成，且被拦截请求仍会计费。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/distillation-defenses","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T01:46:47.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"h4a42egvfit49ylovjrlhspth"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Blokkily 开源实验性模式优先 DAW，支持 MCP 与 CLAP、VST3 插件","summary":"Blokkily 是一款实验性模式优先 DAW，以同一事件模型驱动 tracker、钢琴卷帘和步进网格三个同步编辑器，并通过 MCP 让 AI agent 读取会话、写入音符、控制播放和调用界面方法。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andrewfader/blokkily","publishedAt":"2026-10-12T23:21:12.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"c2ca61w4v4atohkkn738dx4oj"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Lix 2.96 “Bingsu” 发布，推进 RPC 与 Rust 集成并改进调试器","summary":"Lix 团队发布 Lix 2.96 “Bingsu”，改进 REPL 和调试器，推出实验性的 RPC 协议，并将 ssh:// 存储 URI 标记为已弃用。该版本包含多项破坏性变更，包括 flake.nix 校验规则调整、floor 和 ceil 的精度损失报错，以及部分 nix3 命令不再自动构建参数。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://lix.systems/blog/2026-10-13-lix-2.96-release/","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T21:17:07.868Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"v467zmcqdp4r9i5df03slfwd8"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"PostgreSQL 19 多项功能回滚背后的原因与开发流程反思","summary":"作者回顾 PostgreSQL 19 beta 阶段约 8 到 10 项重要功能被回滚的情况，认为原因包括 LLM 辅助审查发现大量边缘问题、安全修复工作挤压了额外审查与测试，以及系统复杂度带来的架构缺陷。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"http://peter.eisentraut.org/blog/2026/10/09/the-reverts-will-continue-until-morale-improves","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:37:06.816Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"y2q3q0czf9wgan5ol4j36lnnj"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":4,"sourcesCount":2,"firstPartyEvents":0},"readingMinutes":2,"prev":"2026-10-13","next":"2026-10-15"}